LIBRAE AI LABS - CAHAYA Sovereign Platform
=========================================

Thank you for downloading CAHAYA Sovereign for Linux.

To complete the installation:
1. Make this AppImage executable: chmod +x cahaya-linux.AppImage
2. Run the AppImage. Ensure the local background FastAPI daemon is running (bound to 127.0.0.1).
3. Launch the application and enter your hardware-locked license key.

If you do not have a license key, please contact:
theenesanvk@librae.work

